    {
      "number": 20,
      "animations": [],
      "text": "A basis for a vector space is aset of vectors that satisfies twokey properties:They are linearlyindependent.They span the space.2Basis",
      "textNodes": 5,
      "images": 1,
      "nodes": 90,
      "background": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)",
      "file": "/sources/canva-native/20.html"
    },
    {
      "number": 21,
      "animations": [],
      "text": "By definition, this set of vectors isalso a basis!2Basis",
      "textNodes": 3,
      "images": 1,
